{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth in this <strong>brutal Action-Adventure</strong> inspired by <strong>Heroic Fantasy Classics</strong>.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush your enemies</strong>, struggle against fate and become the usurper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let none stand against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master a unique combat system and cut down your foes.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/82ff5f9ae6c19154b28478e2498ce33c.poster.avif?t=1768497415\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/82ff5f9ae6c19154b28478e2498ce33c.webm?t=1768497415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/82ff5f9ae6c19154b28478e2498ce33c.mp4?t=1768497415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer <strong>attacking head-on or waiting patiently for a chance to counterattack</strong>, you have the freedom and tools to adapt your playstyle. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/15628a25d98b72351d52abc45528dadb.poster.avif?t=1768497415\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/15628a25d98b72351d52abc45528dadb.webm?t=1768497415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/15628a25d98b72351d52abc45528dadb.mp4?t=1768497415\" type=\"video/mp4\">